# 'rimanenti' is this locale's own word for the time that remains: it is the
# word timer_status.dialog already speaks, Il timer {name} ha {remaining} rimanenti.
# 'sinistra' below is the DIRECTION left and does not belong here. It is kept
# so no phrasing is lost until a speaker removes it. Both lines unvouched.
rimanenti
fatto
fine
lungo
pronto
sinistra
stato
